WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:05.600
Arroyos.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.920
Brooks, please stop.

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:09.960
Brooks, who let you in?

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.640
Get out of here.

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.040
I did.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.520
Morning.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:20.240
Morning.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.440
Weren't you supposed to come later.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.480
What the hell?

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:31.040
Get rid of her.

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:32.440
Now.

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:42.480
Meg,

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:45.440
there is no time.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.480
Finish putting it on, out there.

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:51.320
What are you doing?

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:52.360
Brooks.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:54.320
Listen, I'll call you

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.240
and explain everything.

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:55.840
What? No.

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:56.320
Just...

00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:59.200
Just... just go, please.

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:00.080
Brooks.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.040
Brooks, stop it.

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:02.240
Don't go outside.

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:03.120
Damn it.

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.440
Forget about the damn dog.

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:07.000
Wake up.

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:09.080
Our family's future is being

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:10.440
decided right now.

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.840
In debt or in wealth.

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:14.400
Got it, son?

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:15.880
Got it.

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:17.840
Then get your shit together.

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:19.480
Hurry up.

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:26.280
Walt,

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:28.440
What are you

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:30.040
standing around for?

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:32.240
We have a few hours

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:33.920
to find you a decent girl.

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:35.240
Do you really want

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:36.280
your father’s millions to go

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:37.000
to someone

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.200
who doesn't deserve it?

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:40.360
I'm in.

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:44.360
You'll get a decent girl.
